<section class="hero-line intelligence-hero"><div><span class="eyebrow">ILMIY RAHBARLAR</span><h1>Ilmiy rahbar yuklamasi</h1><p>Faqat nechta magistrant biriktirilgani emas — natija, muammoli talaba, ochiq topshiriq va tasdiqlash navbati birga ko‘rinadi.</p></div><div class="hero-actions"><a class="secondary" href="/insights/risks">Erta ogohlantirish</a><a class="primary" href="/milestones">Dissertatsiya bosqichlari →</a></div></section>
<section class="panel"><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Ilmiy rahbar</th><th>Yuklama</th><th>Davomat</th><th>Reja</th><th>Dissertatsiya</th><th>Ilmiy</th><th>Muammoli</th><th>Ochiq topshiriq</th><th>Tasdiqlash</th></tr></thead><tbody><% rows.forEach(x=>{ %><tr><td><b><%= x.name %></b><small><%= x.department %></small></td><td><span class="status <%= x.loadTone %>"><%= x.total %> ta</span></td><td><%= x.attendance %>%</td><td><%= x.plan %>%</td><td><b><%= x.dissertation %>%</b></td><td><%= x.science %>%</td><td><span class="status <%= x.red?'red':'green' %>"><%= x.red %></span></td><td><%= x.open %></td><td><%= x.pending %></td></tr><% }) %></tbody></table></div></section>
<section class="insight-note"><b>Nima uchun foydali?</b><span>Bir rahbarga haddan tashqari ko‘p magistrant biriktirilganini va qaysi rahbar guruhida natija pasayayotganini rahbariyat darhol ko‘radi.</span></section>
